  },
  "sections": [
    {
      "label": "Verse 1",
      "lines": [
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "chord": "D",
              "text": "How I long to breathe the air of heaven"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "chord": "Bm",
              "text": "Where pain is gone, and mercy fills the streets"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "chord": "D",
              "text": "To look upon the one who bled to save me"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "chord": "G",
              "text": "And walk with him for all eternity"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "Chorus 1",
      "lines": [
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "chord": "D",
              "text": "Oh, there will be a day when all will bow before Him"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "chord": "D",
              "text": "There will be a day when death will be no more"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "chord": "D",
              "text": "Standing face to face with He who died and rose again"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "chord": "G",
              "text": "Holy, holy is the Lord"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "Verse 2",
      "lines": [
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "chord": "D",
              "text": "And every prayer we prayed in desperation"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "chord": "Bm",
              "text": "The songs of faith we sang through doubt and fear"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "chord": "D",
              "text": "In the end, we will see that it was worth it"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "chord": "G",
              "text": "When He returns to wipe away our tears"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
